- Experience working in BARMM or similar peacebuilding, post-conflict, or fragile contexts is an advantage;

- Experience engaging and coordinating with stakeholders involved in peacebuilding, governance, or development programmes is an advantage;

- Proficiency in the use of Microsoft Office applications, particularly Excel, Word, PowerPoint, and Outlook;

- Experience in the use of spreadsheet and database applications, enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems, and web-based management platforms.

Required Language(s):

- Fluency in English and Filipino is required.

